> Connect a model API

  Self-hosted server · http://localhost:8000/v1

  Enter its API key, or leave it empty if it needs none.
  The key is stored owner-only in your UnieAI home.

╭API key (optional)────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Press Enter without a key if it has none                                      │
